# What CI and the release job install next to the package's dev extra (pyproject.toml).
# The library itself pins nothing; this pins only the tools that test, build and check it.
# editables is hatchling's editable-install hook, needed because CI installs with
# --no-build-isolation so the build backend also comes from the hashed file.
